<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clans</h1>
<p>On the 3rd Day of the Month of the Ancient Darkness, Year 270, the 
inhabitants of Valhalla realized they had been abandoned by the gods. The 
strongest formed groups to protect each other and to set out to make a 
better life for their members. These groups built homes and hired guards 
to protect themselves. Now, many years later, they have a safe home, a 
place to store equipment, their own clan bank, and even a messaging system.
</p><p>A clan is a group of players with a house of their own. As a member you 
get:
</p>
<ul><li>the clan's tattoo, and the clan house as your hometown (word of recall takes you there);</li>
<li>the clan chest, for the clan's money and its shared equipment;</li>
<li>a place in the clan's ranks, from the newest member up to the Master who leads it.</li></ul>
<p>To join, ask a clan's Master, one of its Lords, or a member of rank 10 or 
higher to take you in (<a cmd='#'>Help Caccept</a>). <a cmd='#'>clist</a> lists the clans and their 
Masters. You can be in only one clan, and you can leave again with 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cdefect</a>. To found a new clan, see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Startup</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
